@startuml Singleton

class Logger {
    -{static} instance_ : Logger
    -mutex_ : mutex
    -Logger()
    +{static} instance() : Logger&
    +log(message: string) : void
}

Logger --> Logger : returns\nsingle instance

note right of Logger
  Constructor is private;
  instance() is the only
  access point and lazily
  creates the one instance
  on first call.
end note

@enduml